.* QUIINFO: the Information Assistant options, a menu without a
.* command line; F9 asks for one. The INFO menu object itself belongs
.* to the task menus (ui/menus/sys/).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='INFO'.
:KEYL NAME=INFOKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='RETURN 9'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=INFO HELP=HLPINFO KEYL=INFOKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Information Assistant Options
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='HELP HLPWHERE'.Where do I look for information?
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='HELP HLPCMNT'.How can I comment on information?
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPINFO.Information Assistant Options - Help
:P.This menu points to where the system's own information is kept.
Type an option number and press Enter.
:P.F9 gives a command line, F3 leaves the menu and F12 returns to the
display shown before it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWHERE.Where to Look for Information - Help
:P.Every display has help: press F1 (or Help) on it. With the cursor on
a field, F1 tells about that field; elsewhere it tells about the whole
display.
:P.For a command, type its name and press F4 to prompt it; F1 on the
prompt display tells about each parameter. The command menus (GO
MAJOR) list the commands by what they do.
:P.Messages tell more when you put the cursor on them and press F1.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMNT.Commenting on Information - Help
:P.Quartz Systems welcomes remarks on the system's displays, help and
messages. Write down the display's title and identifier (the name in
its upper left corner) and what you would change, and send them to
your Quartz Systems contact.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
